==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|поддава́ть|-ся}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|поддава́ться}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-поддаваться.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|поддава́ться|impf|pf=подда́ться}}

# to [[yield]] to, to [[give in]], to [[fall]] for, to [[cave in]]
# to hold back (in a game), to intentionally let the opponent win or take the upper hand
# to respond to (about a medical condition being responsive to a particular treatment)
# {{infl of|ru|поддава́ть||pass}}

====Usage notes====
* Not to be confused with {{l|ru|подава́ться}}

